sequenceDiagram
  participant C as clients
  participant R as room
  participant G as GitLab
  R->>G: open: load the branch, or pull upstream
  C->>R: gitlab:save
  R->>G: one commit (the bot's token), if head = base
  G-->>R: head moved: merge upstream, retry (3×)
  Note over R: auto: AutoCommit after the last edit,<br/>LeaveDelay after the last user left
  R->>G: the same commit
  G->>R: webhook: a push
  Note over R: merge into the open rooms
  R-->>C: saved / merged / conflict / unchanged / error
